                "text": "Stacy is one of millions of Americans who opened her health insurance letter and saw her premium skyrocket. She called it \u201cdevastating\u201d and she\u2019s right.\n\nWhile Republicans refuse to extend ACA tax credits, @HouseDemocrats are fighting to ensure every individual can access the affordable care they deserve.",
