                "text": "The Trump Administration would rather shut down our airports and drive up healthcare costs than reopen the government.\n\nOur already understaffed air traffic controllers and our TSA officers are working without pay during the busiest travel season of the year, creating a serious safety risk in our skies.\n\n@HouseDemocrats are fighting every day to reopen the government and to protect healthcare for millions of Americans.\n\nhttps://t.co/QmKZD8WQto",
