                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I was grateful to be with my NJ Dem colleagues and so many of you last night to discuss how we\u2019re fighting Republicans\u2019 cuts to SNAP. \n\nThank you to everyone for staying engaged. It\u2019s time for Republicans to stop standing in the way of protecting healthcare, lowering costs, and reopening the government.",
