                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "All Americans deserve access to affordable, quality healthcare. Full stop. \n\nThis deal doesn\u2019t deliver the results that Americans are rightfully demanding and if it comes to the House, I will be a hard no. I have and will continue to hold the line - no matter what.",
